# Recursively List Files

```python
import os
def list_files(path):
    for entry in os.listdir(path):
        full = os.path.join(path, entry)
        if os.path.isdir(full):
            list_files(full)   # recurse into subdirectory
        else:
            print(full)
```
This is how search tools and malware scanners traverse file systems.

